#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:329
msgid "==> Executing command: {}"
msgstr "==> Izvršavanje naredbe: {}"

#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:325
msgid "About to start downloading Bottles..."
msgstr "Preuzimanje aplikacije Bottles uskoro će započeti..."

#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:180
msgid "Advanced Status and Logs"
msgstr "Napredni status i zapisnici"

#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:368 assets/anduinos-exe-runner:375
#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:400
msgid ""
"An error occurred while initializing the bottle. Please expand advanced "
"status to view logs."
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do pogreške pri pokretanju okruženja. Proširite napredni status da "
"biste pregledali zapisnike."

#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:361
msgid ""
"An error occurred while installing Bottles. Please expand advanced status to "
"view logs."
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do pogreške pri instalaciji aplikacije Bottles. Proširite napredni "
"status da biste pregledali zapisnike."

