msgstr "Potrebno je okruženje za kompatibilnost sa sustavom Windows"

#: assets/anduinos-exe-runner:320
msgid ""
"Would you like to automatically download and install it? This may take a few "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"Želite li ga automatski preuzeti i instalirati? To može potrajati nekoliko "
"minuta."

#: data/com.anduinos.ExeRunner.desktop:56
msgid "Run Windows executables seamlessly via Bottles"
